  "internal_vs_final_clarification": {
    "note": "'MP-internal' metrics use a model trained on the 80% random-split training subset only. 'Alexandria transfer' metrics use a SEPARATE final model retrained on ALL MP compounds (0% held out), since no Alexandria label is ever used for training/selection either way. The two are not directly comparable sample-size-for-sample-size, which is stated explicitly in the manuscript."
  },
